rity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Tool-result bounding can exceed maxInputChars for small valid configs\",\"evidence\":\"TC-2.2 requires oversized summarizeToolResult input to render head + tail + marker under maxInputChars. src/sdk.ts accepts any positive maxInputChars, but src/inference/adapter.ts:30-36 builds a truncation marker and returns it even when marker.length exceeds maxInputChars. Reproduced from the same formula with maxInputChars=10 and 1000 chars of content: markerLength=75, boundedLength=75, so the rendered input is over the configured bound. The existing test at test/inference-prompts.test.ts:219-233 only covers MAX_INPUT_CHARS=200, where the marker is shorter than the bound.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/inference/adapter.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/inference-prompts.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.2\",\"TC-2.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-03-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Tool-result bounding can exceed maxInputChars for small valid configs\",\"evidence\":\"TC-2.2 requires oversized summarizeToolResult input to render head + tail + marker under maxInputChars. src/sdk.ts accepts any positive maxInputChars, but src/inference/adapter.ts:30-36 builds a truncation marker and returns it even when marker.length exceeds maxInputChars. Reproduced from the same formula with maxInputChars=10 and 1000 chars of content: markerLength=75, boundedLength=75, so the rendered input is over the configured bound. The existing test at test/inference-prompts.test.ts:219-233 only covers MAX_INPUT_CHARS=200, where the marker is shorter than the bound.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/inference/adapter.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/inference-prompts.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.2\",\"TC-2.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-2.1 / TC-2.1: all seven Derivation