rained forms receive real-adapter content and provenance.\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:219:- Ready real-adapter forms carry config-stamped provenance; deterministic-provider forms do not.\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:243:| `test/inference-real.test.ts` | opt-in (`LHC_OPENROUTER_KEY`) | TC-4.1, TC-4.2, TC-4.3 |\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:257:- `validAssignments(overrides?)` → a complete seven-kind assignment map for construction tests, each kind assigned a distinct fake provider/model string.\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:261:**`test/fixtures/openrouter-call.ts`** (Chunk 5) — the real host: `createOpenRouterCall(key, defaultModel)` → `ModelCall` over `fetch` to OpenRouter's OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint; implements the exact `ModelCall` contract (OpenRouter takes one model slug, so the fixture resolves the `provider`+`model` routing keys into that slug — the host-side interpretation AC-1.2 grants), maps HTTP 401/403 → `auth`, 429 → `rate_limit`, 400 → `invalid_request`, network errors → `network`, everything else → `other`, and extracts non-empty assistant text into the `ModelCallResult` success shape. `resolveRealSuiteEnv()` → `{ key, model } | { notRan: reason }`.\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:289:- handler equivalence: the same seeded thread drained under the deterministic provider lands the same form rows (states, subjects) with marker content — proving handlers unchanged (AC-2.1)\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:291:- each form's `metadata.provenance` equals its assignment `{ provider, model, prompt }`; deterministic-provider forms carry none\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:331:- `assertModelCallContract(openRouterCall)` and `assertRoutingThroughSdk(openRouterCall, realAssignments)` — the same helpers TC-1.2 ran against the fake, unchanged (DD-13)\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:363:- constructing with neither `provider` nor `inference` → the XOR `TypeError` (no fallback resolution path exists to catch it)\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:377:Lifecycle/capstone deterministic legs (Epic 04's exercise) are untouched: they run the deterministic provider and never asserted boundary trigger timing.\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:390:| 5: Real suite | `inference-real` (guard testable unkeyed) | OpenRouter fixture, accounting guard, capstone leg | unkeyed: not-ran record asserted in CI; keyed: TC-4.1–4.3 green locally (run recorded in story DoD with model used) |\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:393:**Story-completion accounting for Chunk 5:** the keyed run cannot gate CI (no secret in CI by design). The story's DoD requires a recorded keyed run — date, model, pass state — in the deviation/completion notes. A keyed run that has never happened blocks epic acceptance: the capstone is the integration-readiness gate, and an unexercised gate is the silent-skip failure mode this suite exists to prevent.\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:403:| Silent real-suite skip | TC-4.1's unkeyed leg asserts the not-ran record exists and is not a pass |\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:514:        - \"AC-2.1 / TC-2.1: all seven DerivationProvider operations exist on the adapter, seeded drains land all seven kinds ready, and deterministic-provider handler equivalence is covered by inference-adapter.test.ts.\"\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:518:        - \"AC-2.5 / TC-2.1: ready adapter forms carry assignment-stamped provider/model/prompt provenance, and deterministic-provider forms carry no provenance.\"\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:539:      - \"No fake adapter, shim, placeholder, or mock path was found in production inference code; test fakes are confined to test fixtures.\"\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:580:    planSummary: \"Implemented the Story 3 adapter pipeline behind the unchanged Epic 02 seam: each operation now bounds input where DD-7 applies (summarizeToolResult head+tail+marker under maxInputChars), renders its kind's prompt, calls the host ModelCall, rejects empty/whitespace-only success text as retryable empty_output, and returns trimmed text with config-stamped provenance. Ported the POC's settled smoothing prompt verbatim into smoothing-v1 (the other six templates remain marked pre-dial-in with golden coverage). Handlers copy result.provenance into DerivedFormMetadata at all five form-write sites (messages landForm; turns rendering/projection/chunk-summary); the deterministic provider sets none, so its forms carry none. Wrote prompt goldens for all seven templates plus the two story suites covering TC-2.1, TC-2.2, and TC-2.3, demonstrated red on the new behaviors before implementing, and recorded the new Red files in the immutability manifest.\"\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:587:        reason: \"Replaced the pre-dial-in placeholder with the POC's settled smoothing system prompt, ported verbatim (AC-2.3)\"\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:596:        reason: \"TC-2.1 and TC-2.3: seven kinds ready with canned content and assignment provenance, record-authored outcomes/receipts disagreeing with adversarial canned text, handler equivalence under the deterministic provider with no provenance, empty-output retry/exhaustion/shaping legs\"\ndocs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/001-final-package.json:1:{\"outcome\":\"needs-ruling\",\"storyRunId\":\"03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts-story-run-001\",\"storyId\":\"03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts\",\"attempt\":1,\"summary\":{\"storyTitle\":\"Story 3: The Adapter and the Seven Prompts\",\"implementedScope\":\"Implemented the Story 3 adapter pipeline behind the unchanged Epic 02 seam: each operation now bounds input where DD-7 applies (summarizeToolResult head+tail+marker under maxInputChars), renders its kind's prompt, calls the host ModelCall, rejects empty/whitespace-only success text as retryable empty_output, and returns trimmed text with config-stamped provenance. Ported the POC's settled smoothing prompt verbatim into smoothing-v1 (the other six templates remain marked pre-dial-in with golden coverage). Handlers copy result.provenance into DerivedFormMetadata at all five form-write sites (messages landForm; turns rendering/projection/chunk-summary); the deterministic provider sets none, so its forms carry none. Wrote prompt goldens for all seven templates plus the two story suites covering TC-2.1, TC-2.2, and TC-2.3, demonstrated red on the new behaviors before implementing, and recorded the new Red files in the immutability manifest.\",\"acceptanceRationale\":\"Story-lead is pausing for caller ruling 03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts-story-run-001-ruling-spec-deviation before impl-lead can accept the story.\"},\"evidence\":{\"implementorArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"implementor-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/003-implementor.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"selfReviewArtifacts\":[],\"verifierArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/004-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"},{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/005-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"quickFixArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"quick-fix-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/quick-fix/001-quick-fix.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"callerInputArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"ruling-response\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/story-lead/001-ruling-response-001.json\",\"provenance\":\"caller-input\"}],\"gateRuns\":[{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}]},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"pass\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-03-001\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"005-verify.json marks SV-03-001 resolved and reports no open findings.\"]}]},\"riskAndDeviationReview\":{\"specDeviations\":[{\"description\":\"Retryable failure reasons are formatted `provider_failure: <kind>: <message>` rather than DD-3's literal 'reason is the kind string itself'. The Epic 02 queue copies the provider's reason verbatim onto exhausted forms (failTerminal sets form.reason and metadata.lastError from one string), and immutable Epic 02 tests pin that verbatim copy — so TC-2.3's required exhaustion shape ('reason provider_failure and last error naming empty_output') is only reachable if the adapter authors retryable reasons with the provider_failure code leading, matching the reason-code-before-first-colon convention Epic 02 established. Terminal kinds (auth, invalid_request) stay kind-led and land failed immediately, per the tech design's Error Contract. Story 4's classification tests (TC-3.1 asserts the same exhaustion shape for network) should consume this format.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story implementor surfaced this spec deviation during bounded child execution.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/03-the-adapter-and-the-seven-prompts/003-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null}],\"assumedRisks\":[],\"scopeChanges\":[],\"productionPathDecisionItems\":[]},\"diffReview\":{\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/inference/adapter.ts\",\"reason\":\"Five-step operation pipeline: tool-result input bounding (DD-7), empty/whitespace-only success classified empty_output retryable (AC-2.4), output shaping via trim, classified failure reasons (retryable reasons lead with the provider_failure code, kind named next), provenance stamped from assignment config (AC-2.5)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/inference/prompts/smoothing-v1.ts\",\"reason\":\"Replaced the pre-dial-in placeholder with the POC's settled smoothing system prompt, ported verbatim (AC-2.3)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts\",\"reason\":\"landForm takes ProviderResult and copies result.provenance into form metadata alongside the existing mechanical stamps (DD-4, AC-2.5)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/derive.ts\",\"reason\":\"One-line provenance copy on each of the three turn-owned form writes: turn_rendering (merged with receipts metadata), lower_band_projection, and chunk summaries (DD-4, AC-2.5)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/inference-adapter.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"TC-2.1 and TC-2.3: seven kinds ready with canned content and assignment provenance, record-authored outcomes/receipts disagreeing with adversarial canned text, handler equivalence under the deterministic provider with no provenance, empty-output retry/exhaustion/shaping legs\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/inference-prompts.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"TC-2.2: per-template goldens with fixture embedding and single-turn shape, registry completeness, brief receipt-stripping proven through the adapter against a detailed-lane contrast, tool-result bounding through the adapter operation\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/prompts/smoothing-v1.golden.json\",\"reason\":\"Golden pinning the POC-settled smoothing rendering\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/prompts/tool-call-v1.golden.json\",\"reason\":\"Golden pinning tool-call-v1 rendering\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/prompts/tool-result-v1.golden.json\",\"reason\":\"Golden pinning tool-result-v1 rendering\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/prompts/turn-compose-v1.golden.json\",\"reason\":\"Golden pinning turn-compose-v1 rendering\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/prompts/lower-band-v1.golden.json\",\"reason\":\"Golden pinning lower-band-v1 rendering\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/prompts/chunk-detailed-v1.golden.json\",\"reason\":\"Golden pinning chunk-detailed-v1 rendering including the receipts section\"},{\"p