iptedCall/throwingCall/hangingCall/validAssignments) and parameterized seam-conformance helpers (assertModelCallContract, assertRoutingThroughSdk) back TC-1.1/TC-1.2, with the routing helpers asserting the actual serialized ModelCall inputs emitted during a real intake→drain across all seven kinds.\",\"acceptanceRationale\":\"Story-lead is pausing for caller ruling 02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment-story-run-001-ruling-spec-deviation before impl-lead can accept the story.\"},\"evidence\":{\"implementorArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"implementor-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/005-implementor.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"selfReviewArtifacts\":[],\"verifierArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/006-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"quickFixArtifacts\":[],\"callerInputArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"ruling-response\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/02-inference-seam-and-model-assignment/story-lead/001-ruling-response-001.json\",\"provenance\":\"caller-input\"}],\"gateRuns\":[{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}]},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"pass\",\"findings\":[]},\"riskAndDeviationReview\":{\"specDeviations\":[{\"description\":\"classify.ts's FAILURE_CLASSIFICATION table landed in this story rather than Chunk 4 (adapter result mapping requires it); the table matches the AC-3.1 mapping exactly and Chunk 4's tests will assert it as data\",\"reasoning\":\"Story implementor surfaced this spec deviation during bounded child execution.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context